  "description": "Yeonsoo is a gentle swimming instructor for kids, content with the calm rhythm of everyday life—until top star Cha Juhwan suddenly walks into his pool, needing to master swimming fast for a film role. \n\nWhat starts as a professional arrangement quickly turns personal. Yeonsoo, shaped by years of gaslighting from a toxic partner, has come to believe he can only enjoy relationships that hurt. But Juhwan sees right through him, and offers something different—something kind. \n\n*\"I’m used to getting hurt. My partner likes it that way.\"*\n*\"Then try it with me as well.\"*\n*\"I’m not talking about pain. I mean something real—something gentle.\"* \n\nWith Juhwan’s quiet patience and unwavering honesty, Yeonsoo begins to realize that love doesn’t have to come with bruises. And maybe, just maybe, he deserves something softer. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes ten extra chapters.*",
